// A scenario whose Then contradicts itself: its effects cannot hold together once the When action was executed.
// Expected: the Then of 'Toggle print' contradicts itself: print is available and not available;
//           the Then of 'Set speed' contradicts itself: the speed is set to 3 and to 5;
//           the Then of 'Finish job' contradicts itself: "report.pdf" is removed from the jobs and added to them.

Entity Printer {
    Actions: start, print
    Data properties: speed: int, jobs: a list
}

Role Operator.

Action start { Initiators: Operator }
Action print { Initiators: Operator }

// an action is available or not, never both
Scenario: Toggle print
Given start is available
When start is executed
Then print is available AND print is not available.

// a property has one value
Scenario: Set speed
Given start is available
When start is executed
Then the Printer's speed is set to 3 AND the Printer's speed is set to 5.

// a value is in the jobs or not, never both
Scenario: Finish job
Given "report.pdf" is included in the Printer's jobs
When print is executed
Then "report.pdf" is removed from the Printer's jobs AND "report.pdf" is added to the Printer's jobs.
